@startuml evnt-c4-context
' C4 Context — EVNT (Eventos e Alarmes)
!define RECTANGLE class

title EVNT — System Context (evnt-service)

actor "Edge agent\n(device)" as Edge
actor "Jamilly\n(family caregiver)" as Caregiver

rectangle "evnt-service\n[Eventos e Alarmes]\nSystem of record for Evento;\nurgency-tiered notification" as EVNT #LightBlue

rectangle "GEST\n(gest-service)\nvalidates recognized report" as GEST
rectangle "PAC\n(pac-service)\nComando + Paciente" as PAC
rectangle "ACS\n(acs-service)\nCuidador + routing" as ACS
rectangle "DASH\n(dash-service)\npanel render + confirm callback" as DASH
rectangle "HIST\n(hist-service)\nimmutable audit trail" as HIST
rectangle "GWY / REG\ngateway + discovery" as GWY

Edge --> GWY : POST RecognizedCommandReport\n(REST/HTTPS, device token)
GWY --> EVNT : routes /reports
Caregiver --> DASH : sees alarm, confirms
DASH --> EVNT : confirmation callback\n(real | falso_positivo)
Caregiver ..> EVNT : SSE /events/stream\n+ /events/active (poll fallback)

EVNT --> GEST : validate report (REST)
EVNT --> PAC : resolve Comando/urgencia (REST)
EVNT --> ACS : resolve responsible caregiver (REST)
EVNT --> DASH : dispatch notification (REST)
EVNT --> HIST : append audit facts (REST)

note bottom of EVNT
  No broker (messaging disabled).
  No AI/Hub dependency (ai.hasAi=false).
  No video/frame/landmark ever enters EVNT (LGPD).
end note

@enduml
